OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome brightness possible to
OL,6,Fstart the day, but soon turning cloudy
OL,7,Fwith outbreaks of rain, these turning
OL,8,Fheavy at times during the afternoon.
OL,9,FWinds started light, but becoming
OL,10,Fbreezy later in the day.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FInitial rain will clear
OL,13,Ftowards midnight, leaving a drier
OL,14,Finterlude with a few clear spells.
OL,15,FFurther cloud and outbreaks of rain
OL,16,Fwill then develop early Thursday
OL,17,Fmorning. Winds easing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
