OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FGenerally cloudy with a few
OL,6,Fshowers to start the day, sunny spells
OL,7,Fsoon developing however and becoming
OL,8,Flargely dry by the afternoon. Light
OL,9,Fwinds. Rain arriving later in the
OL,10,Fevening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FUnsettled
OL,13,Fduring this period with showers or
OL,14,Flonger spells of rain throughout.
OL,15,FOften windy or very windy at times,
OL,16,Fwith a risk of gales. Temperatures
OL,17,Faround average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
